 class=\"access-path\">$value['sponsor_canva_url']<\/div><\/dt><dd><pre>&lt;iframe loading=\"lazy\" style=\"position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%; top: 0; left: 0; border: none; padding: 0;margin: 0;\"\r\n    src=\"https:&amp;#x2F;&amp;#x2F;www.canva.com&amp;#x2F;design&amp;#x2F;DAGBd4V_Yx4&amp;#x2F;B2kE1GJY9YrY8JU3HqnyMQ&amp;#x2F;view?embed\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" allow=\"fullscreen\"&gt;\r\n  &lt;\/iframe&gt;\n<\/pre><\/dd><\/dl><dl><dt><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\">&rlarr;<\/span><dfn>theme<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>null<\/var><div class=\"access-path\">$value['theme']<\/div><\/dt><\/dl><dl><dt><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\">&rlarr;<\/span><dfn>sub_themes<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>null<\/var><div class=\"access-path\">$value['sub_themes']<\/div><\/dt><\/dl><dl><dt class=\"kint-parent\"><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\">&rlarr;<\/span><span class=\"kint-popup-trigger\" title=\"Open in new window\">&boxbox;<\/span><nav><\/nav><dfn>share_desc<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (1424) \"&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Note&lt;\/b&gt;: As mentioned in the Registration Guidelines, you need to do ...<div class=\"access-path\">$value['share_desc']<\/div><\/dt><dd><pre>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Note&lt;\/b&gt;: As mentioned in the Registration Guidelines, you need to do the following steps:&lt;\/&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Follow our TikTok and Instagram accounts: &lt;a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/youthbreaktheboundaries\/\"&gt;Youth Break the Boundaries Instagram&lt;\/a&gt;  &lt;a href=\"https:\/\/www.tiktok.com\/@youthbreaktheboundaries\"&gt;Youth Break the Boundaries TikTok&lt;\/a&gt; &lt;a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/worldyouthfestival\/\"&gt;World Youth Fest Instagram&lt;\/a&gt;  &lt;a href=\"https:\/\/www.tiktok.com\/@worldyouthfestival\"&gt;World Youth Fest TikTok&lt;\/a&gt;  &lt;\/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Join our telegram channels: &lt;a href=\"https:\/\/t.me\/youthbreaktheboundaries\/\"&gt;Youth Break the Boundaries Telegram channel&lt;\/a&gt;  &lt;a href=\"https:\/\/t.me\/worldyouthfestival\"&gt;World Youth Fest Telegram channel&lt;\/a&gt;  &lt;\/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Subscribe &lt;a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/@ybbfoundation\"&gt;YBB YouTube channel &lt;\/a&gt; &lt;\/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Tag 5 of your friends and @youthbreaktheboundaries @worldyouthfestival on your posted twibbon on Instagram or any other social media platform.&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Share the program information for the World Youth Festival &lt;a href=\"https:\/\/bit.ly\/WYF24Poster\"&gt;World Youth Fest Poster&lt;\/a&gt; with 3 WhatsApp groups or any other social media groups.&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Take a screenshot of each action mentioned above and upload them to your storage drive. Then, copy the link and paste it into the input forms provided above. Ensure that the folder is accessible to the public and not private.&lt;\/p&gt;\n<\/pre><\/dd><\/dl><dl><dt class=\"kint-parent\"><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\">&rlarr;<\/span><span class=\"kint-popup-trigger\" title=\"Open in new window\">&boxbox;<\/span><nav><\/nav><dfn>confirmation_desc<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (1792) \" &lt;h1 style=\"color: #333;\"&gt;World Youth Festival 2024&lt;\/h1&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-bo...<div class=\"access-path\">$value['confirmation_desc']<\/div><\/dt><dd><pre> &lt;h1 style=\"color: #333;\"&gt;World Youth Festival 2024&lt;\/h1&gt;\r\n    &lt;p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; color: #555;\"&gt;The World Youth Festival provides both &lt;strong style=\"color: #1389FD;\"&gt;Fully Funded&lt;\/strong&gt; and &lt;strong style=\"color: #1389FD;\"&gt;Self-Funded&lt;\/strong&gt; Opportunities. To qualify for &lt;strong style=\"color: #1389FD;\"&gt;Full Funding&lt;\/strong&gt;, delegates must complete all registration steps and fulfill payment by the specified deadline. If not selected for Full Funding, delegates can still participate through a self-funded scheme.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n    &lt;p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; color: #555;\"&gt;The comprehensive expenses outlined in the World Youth Festival payment cover accommodation throughout the program (&lt;strong style=\"color: #1389FD;\"&gt;October 5 - 8, 2024&lt;\/strong&gt;), including airport transfers on the first day (&lt;strong style=\"color: #1389FD;\"&gt;October 5, 2024&lt;\/strong&gt;, for transfer from the airport to the hotel) and the last day of the program (&lt;strong style=\"color: #1389FD;\"&gt;October 8, 2024&lt;\/strong&gt;, for transfer from the hotel to the airport). It's crucial to note that all fully funded or self-funded payments do not cover flight tickets and visa expenses. The fully-funded spots will be allocated based on the registrants' quality.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n    &lt;p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; color: #555;\"&gt;With a delegate quota limited to only &lt;strong style=\"color: #1389FD;\"&gt;200 youth&lt;\/strong&gt;, let's join hands and collaborate at the World Youth Festival 2024. Your contribution is &lt;strong style=\"color: #1389FD;\"&gt;essential&lt;\/strong&gt; for a shared and &lt;strong style=\"color: #1389FD;\"&gt;impactful&lt;\/strong&gt; experience.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n    &lt;p style=\"font-style: italic; text-align: center; color: #555;\"&gt;I am &lt;strong&gt;ready&lt;\/strong&gt; to join the World Youth Festival 2024 in &lt;strong&gt;Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia&lt;\/strong&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n  \n<\/pre><\/dd><\/dl><\/dd><\/dl><\/div>","title":"About Us","about_us":"<div class=\"kint-rich\"><dl><dt class=\"kint-parent\"><span class=\"kint-popup-trigger\" title=\"Open in new window\">&boxbox;<\/span><span class=\"kint-search-trigger\" title=\"Show search box\">&telrec;<\/span><input type=\"text\" class=\"kint-search\" value=\"\"><nav><\/nav><dfn>$value<\/dfn> <var>array<\/var> (13)<\/dt><dd><dl><dt><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\">&rlarr;<\/span><dfn>id<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (1) \"5\"<div class=\"access-path\">$value['id']<\/div><\/dt><\/dl><dl><dt><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\">&rlarr;<\/span><dfn>program_id<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (1) \"6\"<div class=\"access-path\">$value['program_id']<\/div><\/dt><\/dl><dl><dt><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\">&rlarr;<\/span><dfn>page_name<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (5) \"about\"<div class=\"access-path\">$value['page_name']<\/div><\/dt><\/dl><dl><dt><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\">&rlarr;<\/span><dfn>menu_path<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (9) \"\/about-us\"<div class=\"access-path\">$value['menu_path']<\/div><\/dt><\/dl><dl><dt class=\"kint-parent\"><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\">&rlarr;<\/span><span class=\"kint-popup-trigger\" title=\"Open in new window\">&boxbox;<\/span><nav><\/nav><dfn>about_ybb<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (2409) \"&lt;p&gt;Youth Break the Boundaries (YBB) is a foundation that focuses on all inst...<div class=\"access-path\">$value['about_ybb']<\/div><\/dt><dd><pre>&lt;p&gt;Youth Break the Boundaries (YBB) is a foundation that focuses on all instruments regarding the development and empowerment of the youth to prepare excellent future leaders by promoting strong identity and character and also providing noble values for the youth. The foundation continues to make various innovations in youth activities to achieve consistency in building the character of young people. Since 2017, YBB has been hosting the \"Youth Education and Entrepreneurship Summit (YEES!)\" now known as the Istanbul Youth Summit in Istanbul, garnering a warm welcome from youth communities worldwide. Today, Youth Break the Boundaries (YBB) stands as one of the world's largest platforms for youth collaboration, offering a wide range of activities and an extensive alumni network.&lt;p&gt; &lt;p&gt;In today's era, we recognize the pressing need to address diverse global challenges. This includes fostering leadership qualities, seizing opportunities, and promoting collaboration among young individuals. The World Youth Festival emerges as a pivotal platform, accelerating the potential of global youth to shape tomorrow's leaders. It offers more than just a gathering; it's a catalyst for youth empowerment and development, fostering networking and collaboration to drive positive change. Participants will delve into various themes like education, food and beverages, fintech, environment, and creative industries, gaining insights from diverse perspectives worldwide. By expanding networks and opening new horizons, our goal is to empower the next generation with the skills needed to lead confidently and drive forward national development.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUR VISION&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Empowering young individuals with strong moral, intellectual, and emotional foundations to unleash their full potential in addressing global challenges across various fields, thereby fostering national development through training and competition in this program.&lt;\/P&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUR MISSION&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n  &lt;li&gt; Elevate the professionalism, capabilities, and reliability of humans.&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n  &lt;li&gt; Empower youth to understand and fulfill their roles as the spearhead of national development.&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n  &lt;li&gt; Cultivate a sense of responsibility and leadership among young individuals to actively contribute to the development of their nations.&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt; Foster agility among youth to effectively respond to future challenges.&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\r\n\n<\/pre><\/dd><\/dl><dl><dt class=\"kint-parent\"><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\">&rlarr;<\/span><span class=\"kint-popup-trigger\" title=\"Open in new window\">&boxbox;<\/span><nav><\/nav><dfn>about_program<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (943) \"The World Youth Festival (WYF), orchestrated by the Youth Break the Boundari...<div class=\"access-path\">$value['about_program']<\/div><\/dt><dd><pre>The World Youth Festival (WYF), orchestrated by the Youth Break the Boundaries (YBB) Foundation, This platform is designed to cultivate the spirit of entrepreneurship, encourage collaboration, and foster the contribution of youth globally, Additionally, it aims to ensure the readiness of the next generation to tackle the challenges of the future.\r\n\r\nThe dynamic platform serves as a global hub for young visionaries, where innovative ideas converge to shape a brighter tomorrow. The festival also provides a unique opportunity for young leaders from diverse backgrounds to connect, exchange ideas, and collaborate on projects that benefit society. Through interactive workshops, insightful discussions, and networking sessions, participants gain valuable skills and insights to drive positive change in their communities and beyond. Together, participants embark on a transformative journey towards a more sustainable and inclusive future.\r\n\n<\/pre><\/dd><\/dl><dl><dt><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\">&rlarr;<\/span><dfn>why_program<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (3) \"tes\"<div class=\"access-path\">$value['why_program']<\/div><\/dt><\/dl><dl><dt><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\">&rlarr;<\/span><dfn>what_program<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (3) \"tes\"<div class=\"access-path\">$value['what_program']<\/div><\/dt><\/dl><dl><dt><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\">&rlarr;<\/span><dfn>ybb_video_url<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (61) \"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/JtMgkroyd1Q?si=k8u-ODcuzWfk8bQ8\"<div class=\"access-path\">$value['ybb_video_url']<\/div><\/dt><\/dl><dl><dt><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\">&rlarr;<\/span><dfn>is_active<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>strin